    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39582" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">punctĭo</span></b> , ōnis,
			f.
		id., in medicine, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a pricking</i>, <i>puncture</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dolores laterum, qui punctionem afferant,</span>”
				<i>a pricking pain</i>, <i>stitch</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					34, 15, 44, § 151</span></i>
			.—In plur.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">punctiones sentire,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					8, 9, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 25, 13, 94, § 150</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cael.
				Aur. Acut. 2, 6</span></i>.</div>
